WEBVTT

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.430
Haruto, I'm heading out.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.750
The Finals are finally here.
 Afterward, just the two of us will...

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:23.440
Kaito-<i>sama</i>! Kaito-<i>sama</i>! Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:27.760
I won't let it get in my way until I finish hunting all the Numbers!

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:37.680
<i>In the first round of the Semi-Finals, the unexpected Dark Horse, Yuma Tsukumo, reigned victorious!</i>

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:39.620
Yuma!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:40.910
Cat!

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:42.090
Yuma!

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.850
<i>Now, who will be the one to fight against that very same Yuma Tsukumo in the Final?</i>

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.540
<i>The second Semi-Final match shall decide which of these two will!</i>

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.990
<i>The Cinderella Boy without any history suddenly busted into the scene!</i>

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>But his strength is the genuine article!</i>

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:01.950
<i>His name is Tron!</i>

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:05.310
<i>Fighting against him will be this young lad!</i>

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:11.810
<i>The Lone Hero yet to lose against anyone!
 He is a true born genius!</i>

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:14.550
<i>His name is Kaito Tenjo!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:18.950
Kaito, I'm counting on you.

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:21.120
You had better...

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.620
...defeat Tron, <i>that man</i>.

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.260
Kaito!

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.760
Kaito! You better not lose!

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:40.090
I want to fight you!

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:42.670
We still haven't settled our score yet, after all.

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:43.930
Me too.

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:48.950
Astral.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:52.610
Astral?!

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:54.030
Kaito...

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:00.740
Wait for me in the Final, you two.

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:04.890
Huh? "Two"?

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:07.280
"You two"?!

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:09.900
<i>And the actors have gathered!</i>

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:15.920
<i>These two warriors have been invited to the Sky Field!</i>

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:24.540
Wait just a minute!

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:26.680
Yuma, where are you going?

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.920
I ain't gonna watch this in some stadium!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:32.170
Upsie-daisy!

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.080
Whoa!

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:42.250
Yikes! You fool! You're crazy!

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.700
Heh, come watch if you really want to.

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:47.470
My overwhelmingly powerful Dueling, that is.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:53.880
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:59.220
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:16.070
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:21.870
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:26.460
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:32.500
<i>It's too soon for us to turn back now</i>

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:37.590
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:43.140
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:48.940
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:53.980
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:59.450
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:05.120
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:11.290
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:17.380
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:22.070
<i>Now, who do you think will win?
 Will it be Kaito or Tron?</i>

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.700
<i>The gong announcing the greatest battle of the century will now...</i>

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.080
<i>...ring throughout the entire stadium!</i>

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.700
<i>Heart Burning!</i>

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.580
Kaito, you can do it!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:37.130
"Number 63: A Horrifying Dark Strategy!
 Tron's True Colors Revealed!?"

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.960
I really hope Kaito-<i>sama</i> doesn't -over strain his body.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:37.460
Huh?

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:38.130
Oops!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:43.840
What's so funny?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.090
It isn't what's <i>funny</i>.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.510
I'm simply <i>trembling</i>, overcome with <i>shivers of excitement</i>!

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:55.270
I can sense the gaze of that <i>traitor</i>.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:05:00.230
<i>Watch closely the greatest moment, Faker!</i>

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.190
Tron... Rather, Byron.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:09.160
I never would have imagined that you would live on, completely changed in that form.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.910
Interesting. Anyone who dares to get in the way of my ambitions,

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.620
regardless of who they are, will be utterly destroyed!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:20.920
Tron, I won't ever forget how you treated Haruto!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:25.590
I will destroy you for Haruto!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.260
Now, now, let's not get so <i>angry</i>.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:32.890
I've got something waiting later down the line that's <i>sure</i> to surprise you, after all!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:34.930
Enough with the nonsense.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.480
Here goes! Duel Mode! Photon Change!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.830
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.670
Duel!!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:05.550
I'm taking the first turn!

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.760
My turn! Draw!

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.390
I Summon Photon Crusher!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.520
I then equip the Equip Magic, Photon Spear, with Photon Crusher!

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:26.070
Photon Spear can only be equipped with Photon Monsters,

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:30.620
and the equipped Monster is treated as two releases.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.200
He's got two Monsters with 2000 Attack Points!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.040
Here it comes!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.920
I release my Photon Crusher, counted as two releases!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.720
Darkness within the shining galaxy...

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:53.010
Become the light of hope and live as my servant!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.560
The Embodiment of Light will now descend!

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.560
Appear before us! Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:10.030
Kaito...?

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:11.660
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.530
Hmm?

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:18.160
I... set one card face-down and end my turn!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:26.420
So you've stolen <i>that many</i>
 Numbers and the souls of people that it <i>hurts</i>?

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.670
You can hardly stand anymore, can you?

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:31.970
You're wounded <i>all over</i>, aren't you?

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.100
You bastard...

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.100
Even so, you <i>aren't permitted</i> to go to the nurse's office, now.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.060
What's going on, here?!
 Is Kaito gonna be okay?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.060
Eh... Well... You see...

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:48.070
My turn! Draw!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:53.320
I Summon Heraldic Beast Basilisk!

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:03.040
Then I use the Equip Magic from my hand, Blast Medallion,

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:07.170
and equip it with Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:08.460
What?!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.340
He's using an Equip Magic on the opponent's Monster?!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:29.280
Then Heraldic Beast Basilisk attacks Galaxy-Eyes!

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.990
No way! Basilisk's Attack Power is 1000.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.830
It doesn't stand a chance against the 3000 Attack Power Galaxy-Eyes!

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:42.120
When Basilisk battles,

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:45.540
it holds an effect that will destroy
 itself along with the opposing Monster.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:51.210
And when the Monster equipped with Blast Medallion is destroyed,

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:56.840
its controller takes damage equal to half the Attack Power of the destroyed Monster.

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:57.760
Eh?!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:01.770
Go, Baskilisk! Attack Galaxy-Eyes!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.390
I activate Galaxy-Eyes' effect!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:09.190
During a battle, Galaxy-Eyes can Banish itself along with the opposing Monster!

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:13.240
Using Galaxy-Eyes' effect,

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:17.110
both Monsters have been Banished, and Blast Medallion's effect was avoided.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.330
I knew you could do it, Kaito!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:22.910
Return to the field! Galaxy-Eyes!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.170
I set one card face-down and end my turn!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:40.100
Not to bad, considering what a horrible mess your body's in.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.810
Everything's for your <i>adorable</i> little brother, <i>right</i>?

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:52.150
Well, I think it's a <i>good thing</i>. Having a <i>goal</i> and all.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.030
I have one <i>too</i>, you know.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.320
And you see...

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.370
It happens to be getting revenge against your father.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:04.790
Holding a grudge against Dr. Faker,

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:08.170
due to me wandering the
 threshold in between the Parallel Worlds...

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:13.130
...my body turned into the form you see before you.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:21.510
Yes, I lost <i>everything</i>.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.520
I've become completely empty!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:35.070
And that's about the only thing important to me.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:41.870
My hatred toward... your father.

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:47.370
Revenge alone is everything to me.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:51.000
Revenge? For that reason, V...

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:51.670
No...

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.170
You were willing to sacrifice your son?!

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:57.260
Wow! You're actually <i>criticizing</i> me?

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.800
That's a bit odd!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:02.050
You hunted souls for your brother's sake, didn't you?

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:07.390
Naturally, you <i>started</i> doing it for your brother.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:12.150
But didn't you start getting a <i>thrill</i> out of hunting souls one day?

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.650
Kaito...

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.860
Me and you are alike.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.280
We are willing to sacrifice <i>everything</i> for our goals.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:22.320
Shut up!

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:28.910
If it means saving Haruto, I could care less what you say about me!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:29.750
But...

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:34.540
I will hunt your rotten soul!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.550
I'll crush you with my own two hands!

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.920
My turn! Draw!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.510
I Summon Photon Satellite!

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:47.470
When this card is Summoned, it gains a level equal to a Photon Monster’s level on the field!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.890
That means the level of Photon Satellite becomes nine!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.940
And when Photon Satellite is used as Xyz Material,

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.150
It can be treated as two!

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.160
I Overlay with my now two Level Two Monsters!

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.250
I build the Overlay Network with my two Monsters!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.000
Xyz Summon!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.920
This ironic fate will become the foundation!

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:22.680
Turn V's... No, Chris' feelings into an iron hammer!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.220
Swing it down on his foolish father!

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.850
Come out! Number 9!

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.740
Wh-What the?

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:48.830
Whoa!

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:55.790
That Monster is...

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.840
Sky Canopy Star - Dyson Sphere!

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:10.760
Kaito... You...

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:13.890
V's feelings...

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.770
Dyson Sphere...

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:25.320
Here I come, Tron! I equip Galaxy-Eyes with the Equip Magic, Photon Wing!

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.660
I activate the effect of the equipped Photon Wing!

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:39.340
Once per turn, I select one Xyz Monster on the field!

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.340
I select Dyson Sphere!

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:49.260
By absorbing all of Dyson Sphere's Overlay Units into Galaxy-Eyes,

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:55.140
I can increase its Attack Power by 200 points times the rank of the selected Monster!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.020
Th-Then...!

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:01.270
Dyson Sphere's rank is nine!
 That means it gains 1800 points!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:07.320
Then, because I used Photon Wing's effect,

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.160
I can attack you directly with Galaxy-Eyes!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.790
A Direct Attack with 4800 Attack Points?!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.290
That's amazing! He'll end it with one strike!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:19.920
Now that it's been settled, Kaito-<i>sama</i> can get some rest!

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:23.670
Galaxy-Eyes, attack Tron directly!

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:27.220
Photon Stream of Destruction!!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:40.980
A-Amazing...

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:42.940
Now it's...

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.660
What...? Why is your Life...?

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:59.120
Wh-Why?! He just took a Direct Attack worth 4800 damage!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:01.960
That card...

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.590
It's the Trap Card, Change Medallion!

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:09.800
During an attack from the opposing Monster,

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:13.640
I can Special Summon a Level Four or lower Heraldic Beast Monster from my hand,

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:19.480
then negate Battle Damage equal to its level times 1000!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:25.230
Meaning you can negate damage up to 4000 points!

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:28.070
Grr...! That is not fair!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.780
How about it? Are you happy now?

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:37.410
Oh yeah... It's time to surprise you even <i>more</i>.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:42.000
I have a little <i>present</i> here for you.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:48.630
It hurts...

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:50.760
It hurts...

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.430
And it's <i>all </i>your fault, Brother!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.150
And you even promised that you'd heal me.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.320
Despite saying that, you're putting me through this suffering.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.490
Haruto's face is...

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:12.570
Impossible!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:21.040
What are you trying to do, Byron!?

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:25.460
Up until now, I listened to your boring nonsense quietly.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:30.380
I intended to take you on fairly, but...

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.470
I will not tolerate this mockery!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:34.840
Are you angry?

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:35.890
You bastard!

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.720
But you know, I really <i>am</i> Haruto!

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.220
Don't you dare deceive me using Haruto!

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.230
I'm not deceiving you.

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:45.270
I really am Haruto.
 And Haruto is really me.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.360
Remember? It happened back when I kidnapped Haruto.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:55.530
That day, I absorbed all of Haruto's power and memories into my body,

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.200
What did you say?!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.540
And then, you see, we joined together.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.790
Both our hollow hearts joined as one.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:05.750
Haruto!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.800
Both Haruto's will and my own life force are connected.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:12.710
So if I were to do something like <i>this</i>...

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.130
Haruto!

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:17.470
Haruto!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:22.640
Someone go to Haruto's room!
 Protect Haruto!

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.020
Hey, hurry!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:28.060
It's no use! The system's been shut down!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.690
The door won't open!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:34.360
What did you say?! Is this his doing?!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.570
It <i>hurts</i>! It <i>hurts</i>, Brother!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:42.290
Have you... Have you really become connected with Haruto?!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.040
Indeed I have. I am Haruto.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:48.580
Haruto!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:54.920
You can't!

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:59.340
I won't let you go to see Haruto!

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.260
Kaito!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.760
I'm going to see Haruto!

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:06.270
I'll protect Haruto, so focus on the Duel for now!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:07.980
Yuma...

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:09.810
Orbital 7!

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:11.400
Understood!

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:18.240
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.450
What an energetic kid.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.580
Now then, let us continue the Duel.

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.380
My turn! Draw!

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:38.220
I Overlay the Level Four Abercornway and Basilisk!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:45.810
I build the Overlay Network using these two Monsters!

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:47.480
Xyz Summon!

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.810
Come forth, Number 8!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.610
Heraldic King Genome Heriter!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.070
So that's Tron's Number...!

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:03.870
I activate Heraldic King Genome Heriter's effect!

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.450
I detach one Overlay Unit,

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.870
and I can activate one out of three effects!

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.130
The one I choose states that until the end of the turn,

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:17.050
the Attack Power of the Monsters battling this Monster will be zero,

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:22.180
and their original Attack Power becomes Heriter's Attack Power!

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:24.680
It steals its Attack Power?!

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.520
I, you see, will choose to attack Dyson Sphere!

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.570
Thus, Dyson Sphere's Attack Power becomes zero,

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:49.830
and the Attack Power of my Genome Heriter becomes 2800!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.420
But it won't work against Dyson Sphere!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.290
When Dyson Sphere is attacked while it has no Overlay Units,

00:19:57.130 --> 00:20:01.720
it can revive the Overlay Units and negate all attacks against it!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:05.550
How naive! I use all of its Overlay Units,

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.470
and I activate another of its effects!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:11.850
Until the end of the turn, the effects of my opponent's Monsters are negated,

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:16.020
and those effects become Genome Heriter's effects!

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:17.320
What did you say?!

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.360
This time it's taking Dyson Sphere's effect?!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.530
Now Dyson Sphere can be attacked.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.320
Go, Genome Heriter!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.290
Flash Impact!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:07.240
I set one card and end my turn.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:13.910
Now then, the <i>real fun</i> doesn't start for a little bit.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:17.540
Our Duel, you see...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:21.170
...will make the shocks from our 
attacks into reality and assault our body.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:23.970
So, all of the shocks I receive from these attacks...

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.050
You wouldn't...?!

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:33.640
Yup. It means you'll be fighting against <i>me</i>, Brother.

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:37.440
I have to... fight against Haruto?! Don't be absurd!

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.610
It's your turn next, Brother.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:41.940
Let's have fun together, just the two of us!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:49.700
Haruto, wait for me! I swear I'm gonna save you!

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:52.540
Tron...!

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:55.870
It's perfect. Now Faker, you will...

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:59.790
...lose two sons before your very eyes...

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:03.590
...and they'll be crushed.

00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:15.600
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:21.190
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:31.910
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:37.460
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:40.170
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.790
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:48.010
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.170 --> 00:22:53.350
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:58.980
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:05.440
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.950
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:16.200
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:21.790
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:27.050
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:32.550
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:45.520
If Kaito attacks Tron, Haruto will end up taking the damage as a result.

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:47.980
Realizing this, Kaito has been pushed into a corner psychologically.

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:50.990
If this keeps up, Kaito and Haruto will be taken down by Tron!

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:53.950
Yuma! We have to sever that evil heart!

00:23:53.950 --> 00:23:55.410
Hang on, Kaito!

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:57.450
I'm definitely gonna save Haruto!

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:59.620
It can't be...! A new Number?!

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:01.830
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:01.830 --> 00:24:06.170
"Roar, Neo Galaxy-Eyes!
 The Brothers' Bond That Smashes The Darkness"

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.590
Everything is for the sake of summoning this guy!

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:15.930
This time we will be introducing the Chaos Number used by Shark, Shark Drake Vice.

00:24:16.260 --> 00:24:19.060
It's a Monster that thoroughly devours its enemies.

00:24:19.430 --> 00:24:20.600
What're you staring at?

00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:22.690
You look like you would make a good meal.

00:24:22.810 --> 00:24:23.940
You plan to eat me?!
